      "body": "Phase C follow-up is implemented in PR #340 (ready, checks green, queued for protected auto-merge): https://github.com/UOR-Foundation/uor-r4/pull/340\n\n500k/TLA7 decision evidence: shipped A 34.7/39.0/8.0249 WB/179,068 keys; cpy8 residual 35.3/39.6/8.5247/195,650 (quality gain but WB bound fails); mantissa-bit fold 34.6/38.9/8.3097/162,119 (WB improves but no quality gain). The persisted TLA7 witness is 512/512. The selected store shape remains single-key/query-beam; no centroid-width or mantissa refinement adoption.",
